## Every session

1. **Gate** — `.\scripts\run_all_combat_checks.ps1` → **`PHASE0: PASS`** + **`CAMPAIGN_SHIP_AUDIT: PASS (headless)`** (company checks + Q/`[ii7]`; do not pipe harness to `grep`)
2. **Campaign ship** — [`Camp-5` EA checklist](docs/SHIP_PLAN.md#camp-5-ea-checklist) · [`§8` F5 playtest](docs/SHIP_PLAN.md#camp-playtest-acceptance) · [guide user bundle](docs/CAMPAIGN_DECISION_GUIDE.md#user-bundle-2026-05-22) · [§20 pitfalls](docs/SHIP_PLAN.md#implementation-pitfalls)
3. **Parallel OK (default):** Combat maintain + Playtest (F5 §8) — [`PLANNING#parallel-agents`](docs/PLANNING.md#parallel-agents)
4. **Single agent:** Camp-5 / F5 sign-off **or** one Combat fix

